OL,3,AChinese officials say rescue operations
OL,4,Ain 'critical stage' after deadly flash
OL,5,Afloods in Nepal
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death toll in Nepal has risen to
OL,8,F547, officials say, after Wednesday's
OL,9,Fflash flooding devastated the Himalayan
OL,10,Fborder region
OL,12,FChinese officials say that search and
OL,13,Frescue operations have reached a
OL,14,F"critical stage", as a lake dammed by a
OL,15,Flandslide is at risk of overflowing
OL,17,FNepalese officials say more than 100
OL,18,Fforeign nationals have been rescued.
OL,19,FEarlier, they said more than 500 were
OL,20,Fmissing
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
