OL,3,AChinese officials say rescue operations
OL,4,Ain 'critical stage' after deadly flash
OL,5,Afloods in Nepal
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tibet, five people have died and
OL,8,Fmore than 558 are missing, Chinese
OL,9,Fstate media say. It is not clear if the
OL,10,Flatest figures overlap
OL,12,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,13,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,14,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,15,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,16,Fborder crossing
